     {q:"Why is it useful to review fraction, percent, integer, and geometry skills together?", options:["These topics have no connection to each other","Review is never useful in math","These related number and spatial concepts reinforce each other for stronger overall understanding","Each topic must be learned in complete isolation"], answer:2}
