     {q:"A prepositional phrase begins with a ___.", options:["A part of speech unrelated to prepositional phrases","Verb","Noun only, with no preposition","Preposition"], answer:3},
     {q:"A flashback shows an event that happened ___.", options:["At exactly the same moment as the current scene","A concept unrelated to reading","Earlier in time, before the present moment of the story","Later in time, after the story has ended"], answer:2},
     {q:"Personification gives ___.", options:["No special qualities to anything at all","A concept unrelated to figurative language","Human qualities to something non-human","Animal qualities to a human being"], answer:2},
     {q:"Why is it useful to review reading and grammar skills like these together?", options:["These skills have no connection to each other","It reinforces how different language skills support clear reading and writing","A reason unrelated to reviewing language","Review never helps strengthen understanding of a subject"], answer:1}
