     {q:"Why is it useful to review decimals, exponents, factors, and shapes together?", options:["Review never helps strengthen understanding of a subject","It reinforces how these math concepts connect and build on one another","These topics have no connection to each other","A reason unrelated to reviewing math"], answer:1}
