     {q:"Why can a helicopter hover in place while an airplane generally cannot?", options:["This concept has no connection to how each aircraft flies","Helicopters can never remain still in the air","A helicopters rotors can generate lift without needing forward motion","Airplanes are always able to hover exactly like helicopters"], answer:2}
